I have recieved a number of mail messages from people wanting the location of
the Atari ST version of Gem Nethack 3.11.  I'll warn you up front you must have
at least 2MB of memory to run this version.  Also while it will work on all ST
computers it works best on a TT or Falcon.  This version was designed for
640x480 with 16 colors.  It does work on all ST resolutions but ST Medium is
grey and small.  ST Low is very pretty but some of the messages and dialog
boxes are clipped on both ends.  Most messages and stuff are displayed in the
center so you can read enough to know what is going on and it isn't unusable.
This is the resolution that I'm playing in.

It is on Archive.umich.edu:atari/games/nh311gemc.zoo

